<decision #track.expose_loader_content_identities.loader_authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.99 reversibility = "medium" } (
  <question ?q>
  authority digest 应由谁读取和计算？
  </?q>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?raw>
    资源标准与 bytes authority 必须由 Halfcode 负责，host 不应重复资源管理逻辑。
    </?raw>
    <decision-text ?text>
    canonical loader 在解析同一次 raw byte read 时计算每个 business resource 的 authority identity；consumer 不重复读文件或摘要 normalized AST。
    </?text>
    <rationale ?why>
    loader 已拥有 IO、containment 与 provenance，只有这一边界能保持 digest 与实际 authority bytes 一致且不产生第二 scanner。
    </?why>
    <evidence ?evidence>
    dependency snapshot 要求全部 effective content identities，而 0.2.1 loader 当前只返回 ResourceRecord。
    </?evidence>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.expose_loader_content_identities.compatibility_surface apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.99 reversibility = "medium" } (
  <question ?q>
  如何公开 identities 而不破坏 structural ResourceTree consumer？
  </?q>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?raw>
    0.2.1 API 必须保留，新增能力采用 additive contract。
    </?raw>
    <decision-text ?text>
    保留 ResourceTree 不变，loadResourceTree 返回 additive authentic LoadedResourceTree subtype；composeLayeredResourceRegistry 继续接受 structural ResourceTree，新 projector 才要求 loaded authenticity。
    </?text>
    <rationale ?why>
    旧 fixtures 和 consumers 可继续构造/读取 ResourceTree，同时运行冻结链路获得可信 bytes identity。
    </?why>
    <evidence ?evidence>
    现有 public compatibility tests 与 depa-flows 0.2.1 projection seam。
    </?evidence>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.expose_loader_content_identities.effective_selection apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.98 reversibility = "medium" } (
  <question ?q>
  多 layer 的 effective content identity 由 host 还是 Halfcode 选择？
  </?q>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?raw>
    Host 只拥有 roots 与 layer policy，generic selection/digest 规则仍由 Halfcode拥有。
    </?raw>
    <decision-text ?text>
    Halfcode 提供 authentic effective identity projector，按 registry 的 exact effectiveLayerId/origin 选择 loader identity并合并显式 contributions；不解释领域引用。
    </?text>
    <rationale ?why>
    避免 Eidolon/depa 复制 shadow 选择与 digest 校验，同时维持 Kind owner 对 material/edge 语义的所有权。
    </?why>
    <evidence ?evidence>
    现有 layered registry provenance 与 typed snapshot boundary。
    </?evidence>
  )>
)>
